/*
 * Implements semantic validation for method access on a union value.
 *
 * Supported forms:
 *   - unionExpr.method(...)
 *   - unionExpr:.method(...)
 *   - unionExpr.method = value
 *
 * This module is invoked by FieldValidation when the left operand is a union.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::fields::union_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/fields/union_.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-09-21
